    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of 1992, bored teen Vera Novak is tinkering with her homebrew HAM radio when she makes brief contact with cosmonaut Oleg Sergeev. It\u2019s the first in a strange series of events that will force her to re-examine her lone-wolf outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gap Year, the story unfolds as you explore Vera\u2019s apartment, which is presented in comic book panels that expand, contract and re-orient themselves as you explore the space. You\u2019ll revisit the apartment four times throughout the course of a year, seeing changes in the environment reflect the passage of time between the game\u2019s four seasonal acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.poster.avif?t=1754157377\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.webm?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/1cd980b14d22404f519182b53ed8bc06.mp4?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coming of age story complete with interstellar and inter-generational drama.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique point-and-click adventure that plays out through comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully rendered,\u00a0hand-painted setting that transforms as the story unfolds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging branching dialogue system that let\u2019s you influence the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.poster.avif?t=1754157377\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.webm?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.mp4?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\ude80\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2d\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udf20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.poster.avif?t=1754157377\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.webm?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.mp4?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
