 influence the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.poster.avif?t=1754157377\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.webm?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/b49136b79a596377b03516b2a6e15f17.mp4?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\ude80\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2d\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude80\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udf20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.poster.avif?t=1754157377\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.webm?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/4ce697d86e0700a904b292dad448e8a5.mp4?t=1754157377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
